Note on the bundled dataset

The source code above is licensed under MIT. The curated Middle-earth reference
text in `data.js` and `lore.js` (character summaries, relationship labels,
timeline entries, quotes and glossary definitions) is an original study aid
compiled for this project; it does not reproduce passages from J.R.R.
Tolkien's works or from the film and television adaptations.

Names, places and quotations from The Hobbit, The Lord of the Rings, The
Silmarillion and their adaptations remain the property of their respective
rights holders (the Tolkien Estate, Middle-earth Enterprises, Warner Bros.,
Amazon MGM Studios and others). This project is an unofficial, non-commercial
reference and is not affiliated with or endorsed by any of them.

If you redistribute or publish this plugin, keep this note with it.
